SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1788809145
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Happy tears' as council
OL,4,Areorganisation shelved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThen, I saw a text on my phone. Angela
OL,7,FRayner, the Communities Secretary,
OL,8,Fwould make a statement later that day,
OL,9,Fwithdrawing the LGR plan for Hampshire
OL,10,F- the group was quiet as I read it out
OL,11,F- then erupted in cheers.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
